---
// Newsletter — v2 style, dark bg with radial glow
---

<section class="newsletter" aria-label="Newsletter">
  <div class="wrap newsletter-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Nowy poradnik co dwa tygodnie</h2>
      <p>
        Dostajesz krótkiego maila z jednym praktycznym poradnikiem — jak wybrać instrument,
        na co uważać, ile realnie kosztuje. Zero spamu, zero reklam.
      </p>
    </div>
    <form class="newsletter-form" action="#" method="post" onsubmit="return false">
      <div class="newsletter-row">
        <input type="email" placeholder="twoj@email.pl" aria-label="Adres email" required />
        <button type="submit">Zapisz mnie</button>
      </div>
      <label class="newsletter-consent">
        <input type="checkbox" required />
        <span>Wyrażam zgodę na przetwarzanie moich danych zgodnie z <a href="/polityka-prywatnosci/">polityką prywatności</a>.</span>
      </label>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .newsletter {
    background: var(--ink);
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(520px 260px at 18% 40%, rgba(245, 143, 0, 0.16), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(420px 220px at 72% 80%, rgba(245, 143, 0, 0.10), transparent 70%);
  }

  .newsletter-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 72px 20px 78px;
  }

  .newsletter h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    color: var(--white);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .newsletter p {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 420px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #B8B8B8;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .newsletter-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .newsletter-form input[type="email"] {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 220px;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--white);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid var(--ink-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .newsletter-form input[type="email"]::placeholder { color: var(--text-quiet); }
  .newsletter-form input[type="email"]:focus { border-color: var(--orange); }

  .newsletter-form button {
    padding: 15px 24px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }

  .newsletter-form button:hover {
    background: var(--orange-hover);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .newsletter-consent {
    margin-top: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-quiet);
  }

  .newsletter-consent input { margin-top: 3px; accent-color: var(--orange); }
  .newsletter-consent a { color: var(--orange); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .newsletter-inner { padding: 48px 16px; gap: 28px; }
    .newsletter h2 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
